A collaboration event between [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and the webportal known as Yahoo! JAPAN (ヤフー, ''Yafū'', '''Yahoo''') was held from August 14th, 2013 to September 14th, 2013.

==Event Information==
The next collaboration partner for Nyanko Daisensou is the famous{{Color|#FF0000|'''「Yahoo! JAPAN」'''}}！

During the collaboration, if you look up articles related to「Nyanko Daisensou」on the {{Color|#FF0000|'''smartphone version of「Yahoo! JAPAN」'''}},  {{Color|#FF0000|'''the search results page will evolve to a「Nyanko Daisensou」theme!（see image below）'''}}Additionally, within the game, a free{{Color|#4BB6E9|'''「Surprise☆Cat Food Gift」'''}}campaign has started! During a certain time each day, if you open the「Nyanko Daisensou」app and go to the「Cat Base」screen, you'll recieve{{Color|#4BB6E9|'''「5 Cat Food!」'''}}As for this mystery time the「Surprise☆Cat Food Gift」campaign rewards are claimable, there are rumors of it appearing when you look up articles related to「Nyanko Daisensou」on the smartphone version of 「Yahoo! JAPAN」!

Go ahead and look up「Nyanko Daisensou」on the smartphone version of「Yahoo! JAPAN」and get your free「Cat Food」!
